+    ``once_per_args`` considers all arguments, including keyword-only parameters,
+    ``*args`` and ``**kwargs``. Omitting a default value or passing it explicitly
+    counts as the same call, as do equivalent positional and keyword forms.
+    Keyword order does not matter, and unhashable argument values are supported.
